flowchart TD
    Start([Start: AdminResolveQuery]) --> Input[/Input: admin_id, query_id, text, kb_flag/]
    Input --> QUsers[(Query USERS & ROLE Tables)]
    QUsers --> CheckRole{Role == Admin?}
    
    CheckRole -- No --> Err1[/Return Error: Unauthorized/]
    CheckRole -- Yes --> QQuery[(Query D3: QUERIES)]
    
    QQuery --> CheckFound{Query found?}
    CheckFound -- No --> Err2[/Return Error: Invalid query reference/]
    CheckFound -- Yes --> CheckText{Resolution text empty?}
    
    CheckText -- Yes --> Err3[/Return Error: Cannot be empty/]
    CheckText -- No --> UpdateFields[Update status = Resolved & resolution_text]
    UpdateFields --> UpdateDB[(Update D3: QUERIES)]
    UpdateDB --> InitAudit[Initialize audit_record]
    InitAudit --> InsertAudit[(Insert into D7: AUDIT_LOGS)]
    InsertAudit --> Notif[Call DispatchNotificationAsync: Student]
    
    Notif --> CheckFlag{add_to_kb_flag == true?}
    CheckFlag -- Yes --> CallKB[Call KnowledgeBaseManagement: Create]
    CallKB --> Output[/Return Success/]
    CheckFlag -- No --> Output
    
    Output --> End([End])
    Err1 --> End
    Err2 --> End
    Err3 --> End